OL,3,GNEWSAFootball coach charged over
OL,4,Aallegedly breaking ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been accused of coaching a
OL,7,Fyouth football team across Hull and
OL,8,FEast Yorkshire despite being banned
OL,9,Ffrom working with children.
OL,11,FCourtney Branagan, 37, from Hull, has
OL,12,Fbeen charged with engaging in regulated
OL,13,Factivity with children whilst being on
OL,14,Fthe Children's Barred List, Humberside
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe force said Branagan allegedly
OL,18,Fcontinued to coach for two years after
OL,19,Fbeing told he was prohibited by the
OL,20,FDisclosure and Barring Service in 2019.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
